## https://qutebrowser.org/doc/help/commands.html
qutebrowser: Update block lists for both the host- and the Brave ad blocker     | adblock-update
qutebrowser: Go back in the history of the current tab                          | back
qutebrowser: Bind a key to a command                                            | bind
qutebrowser: Save the current page as a bookmark, or a specific url             | bookmark-add
qutebrowser: Delete a bookmark                                                  | bookmark-del
qutebrowser: Show all bookmarks/quickmarks                                      | bookmark-list
qutebrowser: Load a bookmark                                                    | bookmark-load
qutebrowser: Reload bookmarks from disk                                         | bookmarks-reload
qutebrowser: Clear the currently entered key chain                              | clear-keychain
qutebrowser: Clear all message notifications                                    | clear-messages
qutebrowser: Click the element matching the given filter                        | click-element
qutebrowser: Close the current window                                           | close
qutebrowser: Open an editor to modify the current command                       | cmd-edit
qutebrowser: Execute a command after some time                                  | cmd-later
qutebrowser: Repeat a given command                                             | cmd-repeat
qutebrowser: Repeat the last executed command                                   | cmd-repeat-last
qutebrowser: Run a command with the given count                                 | cmd-run-with-count
qutebrowser: Preset the statusbar to some text                                  | cmd-set-text
qutebrowser: Set all settings back to their default                             | config-clear
qutebrowser: Cycle an option between multiple values                            | config-cycle
qutebrowser: Add a key/value pair to a dictionary option                        | config-dict-add
qutebrowser: Remove a key from a dict                                           | config-dict-remove
qutebrowser: Show all customized options                                        | config-diff
qutebrowser: Open the config.py file in the editor                              | config-edit
qutebrowser: Append a value to a config option that is a list                   | config-list-add
qutebrowser: Remove a value from a list                                         | config-list-remove
qutebrowser: Read a config.py file                                              | config-source
qutebrowser: Unset an option                                                    | config-unset
qutebrowser: Write the current configuration to a config.py file                | config-write-py
qutebrowser: Toggle the developer tools (web inspector)                         | devtools
qutebrowser: Toggle focus between the devtools/tab                              | devtools-focus
qutebrowser: Download a given URL, or current page if no URL given              | download
qutebrowser: Cancel the last/[count]th download                                 | download-cancel
qutebrowser: Remove all finished downloads from the list                        | download-clear
qutebrowser: Delete the last/[count]th download from disk                       | download-delete
qutebrowser: Open the last/[count]th download                                   | download-open
qutebrowser: Remove the last/[count]th download from the list                   | download-remove
qutebrowser: Retry the first failed/[count]th download                          | download-retry
qutebrowser: Open an external editor with the currently selected form field     | edit-text
qutebrowser: Navigate to a url formed in an external editor                     | edit-url
qutebrowser: Send a fake keypress or key string to the website or qutebrowser   | fake-key
qutebrowser: Go forward in the history of the current tab                       | forward
qutebrowser: Toggle fullscreen mode                                             | fullscreen
qutebrowser: Re-read Greasemonkey scripts from disk                             | greasemonkey-reload
qutebrowser: Show help about a command or setting                               | help
qutebrowser: Start hinting                                                      | hint
qutebrowser: Show browsing history                                              | history
qutebrowser: Clear all browsing history                                         | history-clear
qutebrowser: Open main startpage in current tab                                 | home
qutebrowser: Insert text at cursor position                                     | insert-text
qutebrowser: Evaluate a JavaScript string                                       | jseval
qutebrowser: Jump to the mark named by key                                      | jump-mark
qutebrowser: Start or stop recording a macro                                    | macro-record
qutebrowser: Run a recorded macro                                               | macro-run
qutebrowser: Show an error message in the statusbar                             | message-error
qutebrowser: Show an info message in the statusbar                              | message-info
qutebrowser: Show a warning message in the statusbar                            | message-warning
qutebrowser: Show a log of past messages                                        | messages
qutebrowser: Enter a key mode                                                   | mode-enter
qutebrowser: Open typical prev/next links or navigate using the URL path        | navigate
qutebrowser: Do nothing                                                         | nop
qutebrowser: Open a URL in the current/[count]th tab                            | open
qutebrowser: Print the current/[count]th tab                                    | print
qutebrowser: Manage processes spawned by qutebrowser                            | process
qutebrowser: Add a new quickmark                                                | quickmark-add
qutebrowser: Delete a quickmark                                                 | quickmark-del
qutebrowser: Load a quickmark                                                   | quickmark-load
qutebrowser: Save the current page as a quickmark                               | quickmark-save
qutebrowser: Reload quickmarks from disk                                        | quickmarks-reload
qutebrowser: Quit qutebrowser                                                   | quit
qutebrowser: Reload the current/[count]th tab                                   | reload
qutebrowser: Report a bug in qutebrowser                                        | report
qutebrowser: Restart qutebrowser while keeping existing tabs open               | restart
qutebrowser: Save configs and state                                             | save
qutebrowser: Take a screenshot of the currently shown part of the page          | screenshot
qutebrowser: Scroll the current tab in the given direction                      | scroll
qutebrowser: Scroll the frame page-wise                                         | scroll-page
qutebrowser: Scroll the current tab by count * dx/dy pixels                     | scroll-px
qutebrowser: Scroll to the given anchor in the document                         | scroll-to-anchor
qutebrowser: Scroll to a specific percentage of the page                        | scroll-to-perc
qutebrowser: Search for a text on the current page. With no text, clear results | search
qutebrowser: Continue the search to the ([count]th) next term                   | search-next
qutebrowser: Continue the search to the ([count]th) previous term               | search-prev
qutebrowser: Follow the selected text                                           | selection-follow
qutebrowser: Delete a session                                                   | session-delete
qutebrowser: Load a session                                                     | session-load
qutebrowser: Save a session                                                     | session-save
qutebrowser: Set an option                                                      | set
qutebrowser: Set a mark at the current scroll position in the current tab       | set-mark
qutebrowser: Spawn an external command                                          | spawn
qutebrowser: Stop loading in the current/[count]th tab                          | stop
qutebrowser: Duplicate the current tab                                          | tab-clone
qutebrowser: Close the current/[count]th tab                                    | tab-close
qutebrowser: Select the tab given as argument/[count]                           | tab-focus
qutebrowser: Give the current tab to a new or existing window if win_id given   | tab-give
qutebrowser: Move the current tab according to the argument and [count]         | tab-move
qutebrowser: Mute/Unmute the current/[count]th tab                              | tab-mute
qutebrowser: Switch to the next tab, or switch [count] tabs forward             | tab-next
qutebrowser: Close all tabs except for the current one                          | tab-only
qutebrowser: Pin/Unpin the current/[count]th tab                                | tab-pin
qutebrowser: Switch to the previous tab, or switch [count] tabs back            | tab-prev
qutebrowser: Select tab by index or url/title best match                        | tab-select
qutebrowser: Take a tab from another window                                     | tab-take
qutebrowser: Unbind a keychain                                                  | unbind
qutebrowser: Re-open the last closed tab(s) or window                           | undo
qutebrowser: Show version information                                           | version
qutebrowser: Show the source of the current page in a new tab                   | view-source
qutebrowser: Close all windows except for the current one                       | window-only
qutebrowser: Yank (copy) something to the clipboard or primary selection        | yank
qutebrowser: Set the zoom level for the current tab                             | zoom
qutebrowser: Increase the zoom level for the current tab                        | zoom-in
qutebrowser: Decrease the zoom level for the current tab                        | zoom-out